{"game":"DeathLinkipelago","source":"custom","apworld":"deathlinkipelago.apworld","world_version":"0.13.0","groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99},"doc_fr":"Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.\n\nUn réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.</p>\n<p>Un réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.</p>\n"},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full","doc_fr":"Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.\n\n**Full:** s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.\n\n**Minimal:** s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.</p>\n"},{"key":"death_check_amount","name":"Death Check Count","kind":"range","doc":"How many death checks there will be\nmax is 50\n\nextend_death_limit in the host yaml will remove the 50 check limit","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":999,"default":5,"doc_fr":"Combien de contrôles de décès il y aura max est 50\n\nextension death limit dans l'hôte yaml supprimera la limite de contrôle de 50"},{"key":"has_funny_button","name":"Death Button","kind":"toggle","doc":"If host setting allow_funny_button enabled, then this will allow use of the funny death button","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Si le paramètre host allow funny button est activé, cela permettra d'utiliser le drôle de bouton de mort"},{"key":"death_trap_percent","name":"Death Trap Percentage","kind":"range","doc":"Percent of items are Death Traps","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":100,"default":50,"doc_fr":"Pourcentage des articles sont des pièges de mort"},{"key":"progressive_items_per_shop","name":"Progressive Items Per Shop","kind":"range","doc":"How many items in the shop will be priority","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":10,"default":3,"doc_fr":"Combien d'articles dans la boutique sera la priorité"},{"key":"send_traps_after_goal","name":"Send Death Trap After Goal","kind":"toggle","doc":"Send deathlinks from traps after goal","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Envoyer des liens de mort des pièges après le but"},{"key":"seconds_per_life_coin","name":"Seconds Per Life Coin","kind":"range","doc":"How long in seconds can no death occur to gain a life coin? 0 = disabled, 7min default, 2hr max","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":7200,"default":420,"doc_fr":"Combien de temps en secondes ne peut pas se produire la mort pour gagner une pièce de vie? 0 = désactivé, 7min par défaut, 2h max"},{"key":"use_global_counter","name":"Use Global Death Counter","kind":"toggle","doc":"Will store death counts in the global slot and sync with anyone else with this enabled (might be a bit strange with overriding)","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Entreposer la mort compte dans la fente globale et synchroniser avec n'importe qui d'autre avec ce activé (peut-être un peu étrange avec le dépassement)"},{"key":"send_scout_hints","name":"Send Scout Hints","kind":"toggle","doc":"Sends scout hints about progressive items in the death shop","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true","doc_fr":"Envoie des conseils de scout sur les articles progressifs dans le magasin de la mort"}]},{"name":"Item & Location Options","collapsed":true,"options":[{"key":"local_items","name":"Local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be in their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be in their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"non_local_items","name":"Non-local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be outside their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be outside their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_inventory","name":"Start Inventory","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3} ","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000,"doc_fr":"Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}</p>\n"},{"key":"start_hints","name":"Start Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these item's locations prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these item's locations prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande ``!hint``.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt>.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_location_hints","name":"Start Location Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Commencez avec ces emplacements et leur élément prérempli dans la commande ``!hint``.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez avec ces emplacements et leur élément prérempli dans la commande <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt>.</p>\n"},{"key":"exclude_locations","name":"Excluded Locations","kind":"set","doc":"Prevent these locations from having an important item.","weighted":false,"visibility"